bāhau vāyau bibharti tribhuvanamakhilaṃ tadvaśe vartate ca | kāntāḥ kāntālakāntāḥ prathukaṭhinakucānamrakamrāṅgavalyaḥ kāmenopa dravārtā kulitanijadhiyastaṃ vrajeyuḥ suvalyaḥ | dhyātvaivaṃ mūlacakrāntarakamalakuṭī koṭare yantrarājaṃ sāndrasvānandamandaṃ taruṇataraṇi bhābhāsurāṅgaṃ ca taṃ ca |
