triḥsaptarātreṇa mahānubhāvo devo'pi martyaḥ kimumandavīryaḥ |
kalāpatropetaṃ kamalamapi saṃlikhya sumanastāstadantaḥ śṛṅgāṭadvitayamapi cānyonya puṭitam | 
likhenmadhye devī hṛdayamapi koṇeṣu madanān
ṣaḍantaḥ ṣaṭsvākhyāṃ samabhimatasādhyasya matimān |
smarān patreṣvetat suṣiravivarāntaḥ parilikhejjagatyasmin mantraṃ prathitamiha piṇḍāmṛtamiti | 

janasyetadyantraṃ varakanakapaṭṭena vihitaṃ
jagatsarvaṃ śaśvadbhavati vaśavartī bhavrahataḥ | 

